      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "Package Resolver 0.1.10 should fix this. The package is still called the \"VRChat Package Resolver Tool\" in its manifest (so it will show this in the VCC listing and Unity Package Manager), but now shortens that to \"Package Resolver\" for the Menu Label and Window Title.",
