  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-07-25T13:49:22.695Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "In package manager the title is \"VRChat Package Resolver Tool\". On Unity menu and its own window title, it is \"VPM Resolver\". And change log of 0.3.0 refers as \"Package resolver\".\nThey are inconsistent. I'm concerned someone might be unnecessarily confused by them. So how about changing the latter (menu label and window title) into \"Package Resolver\"?",
